      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-emerald-900/40 rounded-lg p-4">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">Cleaned Output (Case-Insensitive & Trimmed):</p>
        <pre class="text-emerald-300 whitespace-pre-wrap">developer@example.com
