      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      Enabling <em>Trim Whitespace</em> strips trailing spaces copied from document columns before comparison occurs. Toggling <em>Case-Insensitive Matching</em> unifies casing variations while preserving the readable casing of the first encountered record. Meanwhile, blank line filters ensure isolated empty rows do not multiply into unwanted vertical gaps.
