    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-200 mt-4 mb-2">3. Vim Terminal Commands</h3>
    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      For developers needing to execute <strong>vim remove duplicate lines</strong> commands inside server consoles, switching to command mode and entering <code>:sort u</code> automatically sorts the buffer and removes consecutive duplicate entries. If you must retain original chronological order, external shell filtering remains the preferred path.
