  <div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Best Practices for Sanitizing Text Datasets</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <li><strong>Back Up Critical Source Data:</strong> Always retain an original copy before executing permanent deduplication routines inside desktop editors or spreadsheets.</li>
      <li><strong>Check for Hidden Spaces:</strong> Trailing spaces or tab stops copied from web tables cause identical strings to evaluate as distinct entries.</li>
